# `ui.packs`

Query the available UI component packs (filterable by category, tag, prop, slot, event).

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.ui.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `category` | `string` |
| `tag_contains` | `string` |

## Returns

`UiQueryResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `packs` | `map` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call ui.packs --json '{ "category": "", "tag_contains": "" }'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "packs": [
    {
      "id": "@sui/primitives",
      "category": "primitives",
      "title": "Primitives",
      "components": [
        {
          "tag": "sui-button",
          "file": "primitives/sui-button.sui",
          "title": "Button",
          "props": [
            "variant",
            "size"
          ],
          "slots": [
            "default"
          ],
          "events": [
            "click"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```
